$ nexoctl media protection get mem/courses
Video protection of `mem/courses`: disabled.

$ nexoctl media protection set mem/courses --enable --prefix lessons/ --max-sessions 1 --origin https://Learn.Example.com --token-ttl 4h
Video protection of `mem/courses` enabled.

$ nexoctl media protection get mem/courses
Video protection of `mem/courses`: enabled
  Videos:        lessons/ (.mp4, .mov, .m4v)
  Token TTL:     4h0m0s
  Streams:       1 per viewer
  Pace:          2x playback
  Watermark:     yes
  Origins:       https://learn.example.com
  Share links:   no
  Playback:      standard (any HLS player)
  Forensic mark: no

$ nexoctl media protection set mem/courses --max-sessions unlimited --watermark=false --share-links
Video protection of `mem/courses` enabled.

$ nexoctl media protection get --json mem/courses
{"status":"success","target":"mem/courses","bucket":"courses","enabled":true,"prefix":"lessons/","suffixes":[".mp4",".mov",".m4v"],"tokenTtlSeconds":14400,"maxSessions":-1,"paceFactor":2,"watermark":false,"allowedOrigins":["https://learn.example.com"],"shareLinks":true,"mode":"standard","legacyDevices":"refuse","forensic":false}

$ nexoctl media protection set mem/courses --mode advanced --forensic
Video protection of `mem/courses` enabled.

$ nexoctl media protection get mem/courses
Video protection of `mem/courses`: enabled
  Videos:        lessons/ (.mp4, .mov, .m4v)
  Token TTL:     4h0m0s
  Streams:       unlimited per viewer
  Pace:          2x playback
  Watermark:     no
  Origins:       https://learn.example.com
  Share links:   yes
  Playback:      advanced (Nexo player only)
  Forensic mark: yes

$ nexoctl media protection set mem/courses --legacy-devices standard
Video protection of `mem/courses` enabled.

$ nexoctl media protection get mem/courses
Video protection of `mem/courses`: enabled
  Videos:        lessons/ (.mp4, .mov, .m4v)
  Token TTL:     4h0m0s
  Streams:       unlimited per viewer
  Pace:          2x playback
  Watermark:     no
  Origins:       https://learn.example.com
  Share links:   yes
  Playback:      advanced (Nexo player only), standard for the browsers without MSE
  Forensic mark: yes

$ nexoctl media token mem/courses/lessons/intro.mp4 --subject student-1842 --watermark mario.rossi@example.com
Playback token of `mem/courses/lessons/intro.mp4` for student-1842, valid until 2026-01-01T02:00:00Z (session 00000000000000000000000000000001).
Playlist: http://admin.mem.test/nexo/media/v1/courses/master.m3u8?key=lessons%2Fintro.mp4&pt=tok1
Player:   http://admin.mem.test/nexo/media/player/#/nexo/media/v1/courses/master.m3u8?key=lessons%2Fintro.mp4&pt=tok1

$ nexoctl media token --json --ttl 30m mem/courses/lessons/intro.mp4 --subject student-7
{"status":"success","target":"mem/courses/lessons/intro.mp4","bucket":"courses","key":"lessons/intro.mp4","subject":"student-7","token":"tok2","sessionId":"00000000000000000000000000000002","expiresAt":"2026-01-01T00:30:00Z","playlist":"http://admin.mem.test/nexo/media/v1/courses/master.m3u8?key=lessons%2Fintro.mp4&pt=tok2","player":"http://admin.mem.test/nexo/media/player/#/nexo/media/v1/courses/master.m3u8?key=lessons%2Fintro.mp4&pt=tok2"}

$ nexoctl media revoke mem/courses --session 00000000000000000000000000000001
Playback token 00000000000000000000000000000001 of `mem/courses` revoked.

$ nexoctl media revoke mem/courses --subject student-7
Playback tokens of student-7 for `mem/courses` revoked.

$ nexoctl media trace mem/courses/lessons/intro.mp4 --bits 10
Code read from the copy of `mem/courses/lessons/intro.mp4`: 10 (2 bits known)
#    SUBJECT                  SESSION                          AGREE     ISSUED
1    student-1842             00000000000000000000000000000001 2/2       2026-01-01T00:00:00Z  (mario.rossi@example.com)
Few bits known: several tokens may agree by chance; a longer copy narrows them down.

$ nexoctl media trace --json mem/courses/lessons/intro.mp4 --bits 01
{"status":"success","target":"mem/courses/lessons/intro.mp4","bucket":"courses","key":"lessons/intro.mp4","bits":"01","matches":[{"sessionId":"00000000000000000000000000000002","subject":"student-7","key":"lessons/intro.mp4","issuedAt":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","expiresAt":"2026-01-01T02:00:00Z","code":"0000000000000002","agree":2,"compared":2}]}

